 the perfect fit for my busy schedule. I was able to work full-time while pursuing my degree, thanks to the flexibility and convenience of online learning. \\\"\",\"designation\":\"UI\\/UX Designer\",\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/client-04.png\",\"id\":982,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_id\":\"d3314fa\"},{\"name\":\"Nancy Phipps\",\"testimonial\":\"\\u201c Attending EduVibe School of Business was one of the best decisions I\'ve ever made. The curriculum was practical and industry-focused, and I was able to apply what I learned in the classroom.\\\"\",\"designation\":\"Digital Marketer\",\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/client-01.png\",\"id\":980,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_id\":\"2c559c3\"},{\"name\":\"Adam Smith\",\"testimonial\":\"\\u201c I have been using EduVibe for the past six months, and I can honestly say that it has transformed my learning experience. The platform is incredibly user-friendly, and the courses are well-structured and engaging. \\u201d\",\"designation\":\"Web Developer\",\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/client-02.png\",\"id\":983,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_id\":\"ee920c9\"},{\"name\":\"Jhaniel Devora\",\"testimonial\":\"\\u201c The courses were engaging and the instructors were knowledgeable and supportive. The online platform was easy to use, and I appreciated the flexibility it offered me as a working professional.  \\u201d\",\"designation\":\"SEO Specialist\",\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/client-03.png\",\"id\":981,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_id\":\"695f096\"},{\"name\":\"Walter Wilford\",\"testimonial\":\"\\u201c The online platform was easy to navigate and the instructors were knowledgeable and engaging. I was able to learn at my own pace, which was perfect for my busy schedule.  \\u201d\",\"designation\":\"JavaScript Engineer\",\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/client-04.png\",\"id\":982,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_id\":\"48c3423\"},{\"name\":\"Mark Ronson\",\"testimonial\":\"\\u201c The courses were practical and relevant to my career goals, and I was able to apply what I learned immediately in my job. Overall, I highly recommend EduVibe to anyone looking for quality learning. \\u201d\",\"designation\":\"Digital Marketer\",\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/client-01.png\",\"id\":980,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_id\":\"d9f5b74\"}],\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-15\",\"right\":\"-15\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"-15\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"eduvibe-testimonial-carousel-three\"},{\"id\":\"0c549d5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/shape-23.png\",\"id\":745,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_position\":\"absolute\",\"_offset_x\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":-198,\"sizes\":[]},\"_offset_x_end\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":-77.9,\"sizes\":[]},\"_offset_orientation_v\":\"end\",\"_offset_y\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":114,\"sizes\":[]},\"_offset_y_end\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":13,\"sizes\":[]},\"hide_tablet\":\"hidden-tablet\",\"hide_mobile\":\"hidden-mobile\",\"hide_tablet_extra\":\"hidden-tablet_extra\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"fc69d29\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/themetesting.devsvibe.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/10\\/shape-14-02.png\",\"id\":721,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_position\":\"absolute\",\"_offset_x\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":-198,\"sizes\":[]},\"_offset_x_end\":{\"unit