(1026, 1, '2022-10-08 02:28:05', '2022-10-08 02:28:05', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"72\" height=\"62\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"50\" height=\"52\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-05-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			BETTER LEARNING FUTURE WITH US<h3>Education Is About Academic Excellence</h3><p>Empower yourself with the knowledge and skills gained through online education and best instructors.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/contact-us/\">Get Started Today</a>		\n															<img width=\"318\" height=\"352\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-02-2.png 318w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-02-2-271x300.png 271w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 318px) 100vw, 318px\" />															\n															<img width=\"160\" height=\"160\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2.png 160w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px\" />															\n															<img width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-01-2.png 500w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-01-2-300x300.png 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-01-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-01-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" />															\n															<img width=\"26\" height=\"27\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-01-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"69\" height=\"74\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-06-07-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"30\" height=\"29\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-26-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			COURSE CATEGORIES<h3>Popular Topics To Learn</h3>		\n															<img width=\"113\" height=\"129\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-19-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"176\" height=\"175\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-21-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-21-2.png 176w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-21-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-21-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 176px) 100vw, 176px\" />															\n			<h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/lifestyle/\">Lifestyle</a></h6><p>7 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/motivation/\">Motivation</a></h6><p>3 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/photography/\">Photography</a></h6><p>4 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/sales-marketing/\">Sales Marketing</a></h6><p>3 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/ui-design/\">UI Design</a></h6><p>3 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/creativity/\">Creativity</a></h6><p>6 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/business-analysis/\">Business Analysis</a></h6><p>5 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/data-science/\">Data Science</a></h6><p>4 Courses</p><h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/health-fitness/\">Health &amp; Fitness</a></h6><p>3 Courses</p>		\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-group-03-2.jpg\" alt=\"about-group-03\">		\n															<img width=\"150\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-group-02-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"450\" height=\"590\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-group-01-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-group-01-2.jpg 450w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-group-01-2-229x300.jpg 229w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" />															\n															<img width=\"79\" height=\"71\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-08-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"32\" height=\"68\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-27-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			WHO WE ARE<h3>We Offer The Best Carrier</h3>		\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/student-2.png\" alt=\"student\"><h6>Industry Expert Instructor</h6><p>Online learning has become increasingly popular in recent years, offering a flexible and convenient way for learning.</p>\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/book-2.png\" alt=\"book\"><h6>Up-to-Date Course Content</h6><p>Our platform also features a collaborative learning environment, where you can connect with fellow learners.</p>\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/reward-2.png\" alt=\"reward\"><h6>Biggest Student Community</h6><p>Our courses are designed by industry experts and delivered through interactive online modules with a great community.</p>\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/about-us-1/\">Know About Us</a>		\n			+		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>STUDENTS ENROLLED		\n			+		\n			WINNING AWARD		\n			+		\n			ACADEMIC PROGRAMS		\n			+		\n			ONLINE INSTRUCTOR		\n			POPULAR COURSES<h3>Our Popular Courses</h3>		\n            <a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/the-complete-html-css-bootcamp-2023-edition/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/course-27-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-27\"></a>beginner<button data-id=\"6131\" data-nonce=\"28ed363f31\" title=\"Add this course to your wishlist\"></button><ul><li>16 Lessons</li><li>15 week</li></ul><h4><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/the-complete-html-css-bootcamp-2023-edition/\">The Complete HTML &#038; CSS Bootcamp 2023 Edition</a></h4>\n			<i>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16