(5779, 1, '2023-01-16 19:11:44', '2023-01-16 19:11:44', '<p>Perspici perfectio physicis peripatetici parvis optime comparandarum rapiunt haec attinet beatissimum delectantur quasi capienda copiose genuit totum animalis macello rhetorum</p><p>Reperiemus libentius es perturbatio relinquet magnitudine chryippo posterius responsuros explanetur lingua profuso oblivionis memoria eius caducum tute</p>', 'Question 1Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-1copy', '', '', '2023-01-16 19:11:44', '2023-01-16 19:11:44', '', 0, 'https://themetesting.devsvibe.com/questions/question-1copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
