(5965, 1, '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '<p>Praestat egregius ipsis videbis divitiarum proclivi tui veri iucunde ingenio relinquo hoc officii villae socrates communiter surrexit profuso</p><p>Scisse boves levares modi epicurum praeceptum timiditas familiarem galloni videmus verecunde easdem malum fugiam penitus tui confuse collige socium inquies</p>', 'Question 39Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-39copy-2', '', '', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '', 0, 'https://themetesting.devsvibe.com/questions/question-39copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(5966, 1, '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '<p>Reprehensum quaesivit philosophus indicia ludis explicari solebam contingit honesto squalidius uno memini</p><p>Indoctum cavere nondum lenius actum sanguine iucunda estne epicuro delectari abiecti destitero nemo quadratum quaereremus mutandi</p>', 'Question 40Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-40copy-2', '', '', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '', 0, 'https://themetesting.devsvibe.com/questions/question-40copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
