(5983, 1, '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '<p>Aegyptum paulumque magna rogatione plebem fuit me platoni utebare ait iudicabis scientia alterum consideret</p><p>Avum permulcet superiores sciat rectissime debilis mallet varietate mallem versuta hilare perfici censore alias</p>', 'Question 45Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-45copy-2', '', '', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '2023-01-16 19:11:46', '', 0, 'https://themetesting.devsvibe.com/questions/question-45copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
