(9317, 1, '2022-10-08 02:28:05', '2022-10-08 02:28:05', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"72\" height=\"62\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"50\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-05-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			BETTER LEARNING FUTURE WITH US<h3>Education Is About Academic Excellence</h3><p>Empower yourself with the knowledge and skills gained through online education and best instructors.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/contact-us/\">Get Started Today</a>		\n															<img width=\"318\" height=\"352\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-02-2.png 318w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-02-2-271x300.png 271w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 318px) 100vw, 318px\" />															\n															<img width=\"160\" height=\"160\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2.png 160w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-03-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px\" />															\n															<img width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/image-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loa