width=\"205\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-08-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"57\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-30-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			ABOUT US<h3>Knowledge is power, Information is liberating.</h3><p>Online learning has become increasingly popular in recent years, offering a flexible and convenient way for individuals to pursue education.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h4>People Love To Learn With Us</h4>		\n			<h5>90%</h5>		\n		<p>90% of students see their course through to completion.</p>		\n			<h5>9/10</h5>		\n		9/10 users reported better learning outcomes.		\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/about-us-1/\">Learn More</a>		\n			WHAT WE OFFER<h3>Learn New Skills When And Where You Like</h3>		\n			<img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-03-2.png\" alt=\"shape-04-03\">		\n															<img width=\"54\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-15-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"67\" height=\"74\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-07-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-01-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-01\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Remote Learning</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-02-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-02\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Awesome Tutors</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-03-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-03\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Global Certificate</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-04-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-04\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Carrier Guideline</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p>		\n			FREE WORKSHOP<h3>Join Our Free Workshops</h3>		\n		<p>Join us at our “Free Workshop” event to expand your knowledge, gain new insights, and connect with like-minded individuals. Our expert speakers will provide valuable insights on a range of topics.</p>		\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/event-grid/\">More Upcoming Workshop</a>		\n															<img width=\"138\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-05-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"63\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-09-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pNje3bWz7V8\"></a>		\n															<img width=\"640\" height=\"545\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2.webp 719w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2-300x255.webp 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2-600x511.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />															\n															<img width=\"46\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-08-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			ABOUT US		\n			<h2>Creating A Community Of Life Long Learners</h2>		\n		<p>Our online learning platform is designed to be flexible, enabling you to fit your learning around your busy schedule. You can access the courses on any device, including desktop computers, tablet &amp; mobile devices.</p>		\n			<h6>2000+ Verified Course</h6>		\n			<h6>Expert Instructors</h6>		\n			<h6>256+ Free Videos</h6>		\n			<h6>Big Student Community</h6>		\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/\">Explore Courses</a>		\n			<img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-29-2.png\" alt=\"shape-29\">		\n			<img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-02-2.png\" alt=\"shape-04-02\">		\n			SKILLED INSTRUCTOR<h3>Introduce Our Life Coaches</h3>		\n															<img width=\"137\" height=\"73\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-16-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"180\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2.png 180w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px\" />															\n															<img width=\"205\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-08-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"#\" ta