(9342, 1, '2025-03-05 08:38:56', '2025-03-05 08:38:56', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */<br />\r\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>\r\n\r\nEXCELLENCE IN EDUCATION\r\n<h2>Start Better Learning Future From Here</h2>\r\nEmpower yourself with the knowledge and skills gained through online education! The key to your future!\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/contact-us/\">Get Started Today</a>\r\n\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-circle-2.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 541px) 100vw, 541px\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-circle-2.png 541w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-circle-2-300x300.png 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-circle-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-circle-2-100x100.png 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"541\" height=\"541\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"26\" height=\"27\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-05-05-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"52\" />\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/learning-how-to-write-as-a-professional-author/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/course-33-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-33\" /></a><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/ui-design/\">UI Design</a>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>19 Lessons</li>\r\n 	<li>15 hour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/learning-how-to-write-as-a-professional-author/\">Learning How To Write As A Professional Author</a></h4>\r\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore...\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"52\" height=\"58\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/workshop-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />\r\n<h5>Design Workshop</h5>\r\nToday at 6:00 am\r\n<a href=\"#\">Join Now</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-05-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/video-image-2.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 432px) 100vw, 432px\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/video-image-2.png 432w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/video-image-2-237x300.png 237w\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"547\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"66\" height=\"53\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"113\" height=\"150\" />\r\n<a href=\"#about-us\">\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/badge-2.png\" alt=\"badge\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 470px) 100vw, 470px\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2.jpg 470w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2-271x300.jpg 271w\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"520\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"87\" height=\"116\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-02-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"257\" />\r\nABOUT US\r\n<h3>Creating A Community Of Life Long Learners</h3>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-07-2.png\" alt=\"shape-07\" />\r\nOnline learning has become increasingly popular in recent years, offering a flexible and convenient way for individuals to pursue education and training.\r\n<h6>Flexible Classes</h6>\r\nFlexible Classes refers to the process of acquiring knowledge or skills through the use of digital technologies and the internet.\r\n<h6>Learn From Anywhere</h6>\r\nWhether you are a busy professional, a stay-at-home parent, or a student who prefers to study from home effectively.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/about-us-1/\">Know About Us</a>\r\nCOURSE CATEGORIES\r\n<h3>Popular Topics To Learn</h3>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-08-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"118\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"110\" height=\"99\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"51\" height=\"63\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"87\" height=\"116\" />\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/business-analysis/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/course-26-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-26\" /></a>5 Courses\r\n<h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/business-analysis/\">Business Analysis</a></h6>\r\nThe course covers the tools used in business analysis.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/sales-marketing/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/course-29-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-29\" /></a>3 Courses\r\n<h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/sales-marketing/\">Sales Marketing</a></h6>\r\nYou\'ll learn how to promote or sell services to customers.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/data-science/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/data-analysis-590x430.webp\" alt=\"data-analysis\" /></a>4 Courses\r\n<h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/data-science/\">Data Science</a></h6>\r\nStudents will learn about how data analysis methods works.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/creativity/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/course-27-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-27\" /></a>6 Courses\r\n<h6><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/creativity/\">Creativity</a></h6>\r\nStudents in this course will learn about creative process.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/creativity/\">Creative Courses</a>\r\nPOPULAR COURSES\r\n<h3>Featured On This Month</h3>\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/the-complete-html-css-bootcamp-2023-edition/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/course-27-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-27\" /></a>15 week<button title=\"Add this course to your wishlist\" data-id=\"6131\" data-nonce=\"287586b7da\"></button><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-02-2-100x100.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 40px) 100vw, 40px\" srcset=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-02-2-100x100.webp 100w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-02-2-150x150.webp 150w\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />Janet Fleming(5.0)\r\n<h4><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/the-complete-html-css-bootcamp-2023-edition/\">The Complete HTML &amp; CSS Bootcamp 2023 Edition</a></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>229 Students</li>\r\n 	<li>16 Lessons</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n$45.00\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/grow-personal-financial-security-thinking-principles/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/course-32-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-32\" /></a>17 week<button title=\"Add this course to your wishlist\" data-id=\"6129\" data-nonce=\"287586b7da\"></button><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-01-2-100x100.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 40px) 100vw, 40px\" srcset=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-01-2-100x100.webp 100w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-01-2-150x150.webp 150w\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />James Carlson(5.0)\r\n<h4><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/grow-personal-financial-security-thinking-principles/\">Grow Personal Financial Security Thinking &amp; Principles</a></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>189 Students</li>\r\n 	<li>18 Lessons</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n$59.00$49.00\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/the-complete-guide-to-build-restful-api-application/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/course-38-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-38\" /></a>20 hour<button title=\"Remove this course from your wishlist\" data-id=\"5768\" data-nonce=\"287586b7da\"></button><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-08-2-100x100.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 40px) 100vw, 40px\" srcset=\"ht