et=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-02-2-100x100.webp 100w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-02-2-150x150.webp 150w\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />Janet Fleming(4.5)\r\n<h4><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/machine-learning-a-z-hands-on-python-and-java/\">Machine Learning A-Z: Hands-On Python and java</a></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>674 Students</li>\r\n 	<li>13 Lessons</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n$99.00$79.00\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/learning-how-to-write-as-a-professional-author/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/course-33-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-33\" /></a>15 hour<button title=\"Add this course to your wishlist\" data-id=\"5477\" data-nonce=\"287586b7da\"></button><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-06-2-100x100.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 40px) 100vw, 40px\" srcset=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-06-2-100x100.webp 100w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-06-2-150x150.webp 150w\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />Isabelle Bruner(5.0)\r\n<h4><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/learning-how-to-write-as-a-professional-author/\">Learning How To Write As A Professional Author</a></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>425 Students</li>\r\n 	<li>19 Lessons</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n$39.00$29.00\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-12-2.png\" alt=\"shape-12\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-10-2.png\" alt=\"shape-10\" />\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/\">View All Courses</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-09-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"88\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"101\" height=\"88\" />\r\nTESTIMONIAL\r\n<h3>What Our Student Says</h3>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"130\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"113\" height=\"150\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-01-2.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-01-2.jpg 500w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-01-2-273x300.jpg 273w\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"550\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"68\" height=\"73\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"68\" height=\"74\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/trophy-2.png\" alt=\"trophy\" />\r\n<h6>50K+</h6>\r\nSatisfied Learners\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\" />\r\n\r\n“ I had an amazing experience at EduVibe. The instructors were knowledgeable and passionate, and the coursework was challenging and relevant to my future career. I feel confident that the education I received will prepare me for success.\"\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-01-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-01\" />\r\n<h5>Sophie Moore</h5>\r\nUI Designer<img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\" />\r\n\r\n“ The online courses at EduVibe were the perfect fit for my busy schedule. I was able to work full-time while pursuing my degree, thanks to the flexibility and convenience of online learning. The instructors were supportive and engaging.\"\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-02-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-02\" />\r\n<h5>Lorraine Raines</h5>\r\nWordPress Expert<img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\" />\r\n\r\n“ Attending EduVibe School of Business was one of the best decisions I\'ve ever made. The curriculum was practical and industry-focused, and I was able to apply what I learned in the classroom to real-world situations during internships and co-op placements.\"\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-03-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-03\" />\r\n<h5>David Bard</h5>\r\nJavaScript Developer\r\nTEAM MEMBER\r\n<h3>Meet Our Instructor</h3>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"97\" height=\"100\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"92\" height=\"113\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-06-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"100\" />\r\n<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-01-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-01\" /></a>\r\n<h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">James Carlson</a></h5>\r\nWordPress Expert<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-02-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-02\" /></a>\r\n<h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nancy Phipps</a></h5>\r\nDigital Marketer<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-03-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-03\" /></a>\r\n<h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Troy Hall</a></h5>\r\nPHP Expert<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-06-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-06\" /></a>\r\n<h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Isabelle Bruner</a></h5>\r\nUI Designer\r\nWHY CHOOSE US\r\n<h3>Our Core Features</h3>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-14-2.png\" alt=\"shape-14\" />\r\n<h3>Virtual Classroom</h3>\r\nStudents can access course materials, participate in debate &amp; discussions.\r\n<h3>Remote Education</h3>\r\nComplete assignments from a remote location, such as their home or workplace.\r\n<h3>Digital Learning</h3>\r\nDigital learning allows for more personalized and flexible learning experiences.\r\n<h3>Educator Support</h3>\r\nThe goal of educator support is to promote learning and growth among teachers.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2.jpg\" alt=\"choose-us-image-01\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-15-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"54\" height=\"59\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"101\" height=\"88\" />\r\nSUBSCRIBE NEWSLETTER\r\n<h3>Get Every Latest News</h3>\r\n<form id=\"eduvibe-mailchimp-form-d817074\" method=\"POST\"><input name=\"eduvibe_mailchimp_email\" required=\"required\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your mail address\" /><button></button></form><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-04-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"77\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-16-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"178\" height=\"95\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"52\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-06-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"100\" />\r\nBLOG &amp; NEWS\r\n<h3>Trending on Our Blogs</h3>\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/blog/\">Read More Blogs</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/category/social-media/\">Social Media</a>\r\n<h5><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/2023/02/17/the-complete-web-developer-guideline-2023/\">The Complete Web Developer Guideline 2023</a></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>17 Feb, 2023</li>\r\n 	<li>Posted By <a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/author/op0ddfafe36uas6rv/\">Janet Fleming</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/2023/02/17/the-complete-web-developer-guideline-2023/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/course-06-2-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-06\" /></a> <a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/category/branding/\">Branding</a>\r\n<h5><a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/2023/02/09/social-media-marketing-mastery-a-z-journey/\">Social Media Marketing MASTERY( A-Z ) Journey</a></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>09 Feb, 2023</li>\r\n 	<li>Posted By <a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/author/op0ddfafe36uas6rv/\">Janet Fleming</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/2023/02/09/social-media-marketing-mastery-a-z-journey/\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/course-26-590x430.webp\" alt=\"course-26\" /></a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-17-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"113\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-15-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"54\" height=\"59\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"106\" height=\"127\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-02-2.png\" alt=\"shape-04-02\" />', 'Home 1', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '7034-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-05 08:38:56', '2025-03-05 08:38:56', '', 7034, 'http://localhost/vashi1/?p=9342', 0, 'revisio