lhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					COURSE CATEGORIES<h3>Popular Topics To Learn</h3>				\n															<img width=\"205\" height=\"118\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-08-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"110\" height=\"99\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"51\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"87\" height=\"116\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/business-analysis/\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/course-26.webp\" alt=\"course-26\"></a>5 Courses<h6><a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/business-analysis/\">Business Analysis</a></h6><p>The course covers the tools used in business analysis.</p><a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/sales-marketing/\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/course-29.webp\" alt=\"course-29\"></a>3 Courses<h6><a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/sales-marketing/\">Sales Marketing</a></h6><p>You\'ll learn how to promote or sell services to customers.</p><a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/data-science/\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/data-analysis.webp\" alt=\"data-analysis\"></a>4 Courses<h6><a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/data-science/\">Data Science</a></h6><p>Students will learn about how data analysis methods works.</p><a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/creativity/\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/course-27.webp\" alt=\"course-27\"></a>6 Courses<h6><a href=\"http://localhost/vashi1/course-category/creativity/\">Creativity</a></h6><p>Students in this course will learn about creative process.</p>				\n					<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/course-category/creativity/\">Creative Courses</a>				\n					TESTIMONIAL<h3>What Our Student Says</h3>				\n															<img width=\"143\" height=\"130\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"113\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"500\" height=\"550\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-01-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"68\" height=\"73\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"68\" height=\"74\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/trophy-2.png\" alt=\"trophy\"><h6>50K+</h6><p>Satisfied Learners</p>\n					<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\"><p>“ I had an amazing experience at EduVibe. The instructors were knowledgeable and passionate, and the coursework was challenging and relevant to my future career. I feel confident that the education I received will prepare me for success.\"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-01-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-01\"><h5>Sophie Moore</h5>UI Designer<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\"><p>“ The online courses at EduVibe were the perfect fit for my busy schedule. I was able to work full-time while pursuing my degree, thanks to the flexibility and convenience of online learning. The instructors were supportive and engaging.\"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-02-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-02\"><h5>Lorraine Raines</h5>WordPress Expert<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\"><p>“ Attending EduVibe School of Business was one of the best decisions I\'ve ever made. The curriculum was practical and industry-focused, and I was able to apply what I learned in the classroom to real-world situations during internships and co-op placements.\"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-03-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-03\"><h5>David Bard</h5>JavaScript Developer				\n					TEAM MEMBER<h3>Meet Our Instructor</h3>				\n															<img width=\"97\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"92\" height=\"113\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"75\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-06-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-01-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-01\"></a><h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">James Carlson</a></h5>WordPress Expert<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-02-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-02\"></a><h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">Nancy Phipps</a></h5>Digital Marketer<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-03-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-03\"></a><h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">Troy Hall</a></h5>PHP Expert<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-03-06-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-03-06\"></a><h5><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">Isabelle Bruner</a></h5>UI Designer<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"></a>				\n					WHY CHOOSE US<h3>Our Core Features</h3>				\n					<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-14-2.png\" alt=\"shape-14\">				\n					<h3>Virtual Classroom</h3>				\n		<p>Students can access course materials, participate in debate &amp; discussions.</p>		\n					<h3>Remote Education</h3>				\n		<p>Complete assignments from a remote location, such as their home or workplace.</p>		\n					<h3>Digital Learning</h3>				\n		Digital learning allows for more personalized and flexible learning experiences.		\n					<h3>Educator Support</h3>				\n		 The goal of educator support is to promote learning and growth among teachers.		\n					<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pNje3bWz7V8\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M424.4 214.7L72.4 6.6C43.8-10.3 0 6.1 0 47.9V464c0 37.5 40.7 60.1 72.4 41.3l352-208c31.4-18.5 31.5-64.1 0-82.6z\"></path></svg></a>				\n					<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2.jpg\" alt=\"choose-us-image-01\">				\n															<img width=\"54\" height=\"59\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-15-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"101\" heigh