tp://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\"><p>“ I had an amazing experience at EduVibe. The instructors were knowledgeable and passionate, and the coursework was challenging and relevant to my future career. I feel confident that the education I received will prepare me for success.\"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-01-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-01\"><h5>Sophie Moore</h5>UI Designer<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\"><p>“ The online courses at EduVibe were the perfect fit for my busy schedule. I was able to work full-time while pursuing my degree, thanks to the flexibility and convenience of online learning. The instructors were supportive and engaging.\"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-02-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-02\"><h5>Lorraine Raines</h5>WordPress Expert<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/testimonial-4-quote.png\" alt=\"Quote Images\"><p>“ Attending EduVibe School of Business was one of the best decisions I\'ve ever made. The curriculum was practical and industry-focused, and I was able to apply what I learned in the classroom to real-world situations during internships and co-op placements.\"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/testimonial-04-03-2.png\" alt=\"testimonial-04-03\"><h5>David Bard</h5>JavaScript Developer				\n					TEAM MEMBER<h3>Meet Our Instructor</h3>				\n															<img width=\"97\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"92\" height=\"113\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-03-03-2.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"75\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://localhost/va