(9489, 1, '2025-03-05 12:57:56', '2025-03-05 12:57:56', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"460\" height=\"460\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2.png 460w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2-300x300.png 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\" />															\n															<img width=\"640\" height=\"640\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2.png 739w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-300x300.png 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-600x600.png 600w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />															\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-02-2.png\" alt=\"about-image-02\">		\n        2.98\n        Finished<br>\n        Sessions\n															<img width=\"45\" height=\"41\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-05-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"205\" height=\"118\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-08-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"57\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-30-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			ABOUT US<h3>Knowledge is power, Information is liberating.</h3><p>Online learning has become increasingly popular in recent years, offering a flexible and convenient way for individuals to pursue education.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h4>People Love To Learn With Us</h4>		\n			<h5>90%</h5>		\n		<p>90% of students see their course through to completion.</p>		\n			<h5>9/10</h5>		\n		9/10 users reported better learning outcomes.		\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/about-us-1/\">Learn More</a>		\n			WHAT WE OFFER<h3>Learn New Skills When And Where You Like</h3>		\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-03-2.png\" alt=\"shape-04-03\">		\n															<img width=\"54\" height=\"59\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-15-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"67\" height=\"74\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-02-07-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-01-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-01\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Remote Learning</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-02-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-02\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Awesome Tutors</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-03-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-03\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Global Certificate</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/offer-icon-04-2.png\" alt=\"offer-icon-04\"></a><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-01.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-02.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><img src=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/themes/eduvibe/assets/images/service-icon-03.png\" alt=\"Shape Images\"><h6><a href=\"#\">Carrier Guideline</a></h6><p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.</p>		\n			FREE WORKSHOP<h3>Join Our Free Workshops</h3>		\n		<p>Join us at our “Free Workshop” event to expand your knowledge, gain new insights, and connect with like-minded individuals. Our expert speakers will provide valuable insights on a range of topics.</p>		\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"52\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-13-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/event-grid/\">More Upcoming Workshop</a>		\n															<img width=\"138\" height=\"185\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-05-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"63\" height=\"65\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-09-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pNje3bWz7V8\"></a>		\n															<img width=\"640\" height=\"545\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2.webp 719w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2-300x255.webp 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/choose-us-image-01-2-600x511.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />															\n															<img width=\"46\" height=\"40\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-08-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			ABOUT US		\n			<h2>Creating A Community Of Life Long Learners</h2>		\n		<p>Our online learning platform is designed to be flexible, enabling you to fit your learning around your busy schedule. You can access the courses on any device, including desktop computers, tablet &amp; mobile devices.</p>		\n			<h6>2000+ Verified Course</h6>		\n			<h6>Expert Instructors</h6>		\n			<h6>256+ Free Videos</h6>		\n			<h6>Big Student Community</h6>		\n			<a href=\"https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/courses/\">Explore Courses</a>		\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-29-2.png\" alt=\"shape-29\">		\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-04-02-2.png\" alt=\"shape-04-02\">		\n			SKILLED INSTRUCTOR<h3>Introduce Our Life Coaches</h3>		\n															<img width=\"137\" height=\"73\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-16-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"180\" height=\"180\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2.png 180w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-24-02-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px\" />															\n															<img width=\"205\" height=\"118\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-08-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-01-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-01\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mark R. Ronson</a></h4>UI Designer<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-02-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-02\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Miranda H. Leone</a></h4>Web Developer<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-03-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-03\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Leone P. Xaviona</a></h4>Digital Marketer<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-04-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-04\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yokollili V. Nauia</a></h4>SEO Expert<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-05-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-05\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sasoti R. Chanvi</a></h4>Digital Marketer<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-06-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-06\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hamna D. Viru</a></h4>UX Expert<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-07-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-07\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Samuel D. Smith</a></h4>UX Expert<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/instructor-01-08-2.webp\" alt=\"instructor-01-08\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><h4><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jhamina Y. Diva</a></h4>UX Expert		\n			TESTIMONIALS<h3>Our Lovely Students Feedback</h3>		\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/client-03-2.png\" alt=\"client-03\"><h6>Stive Marlone</h6>Web Developer<p>“ I had an amazing experience at EduVibe. The instructors were knowledgeable and passionate, and the coursework was challenging and relevant to my future career. \"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/client-04-2.png\" alt=\"client-04\"><h6>James Carlson</h6>UI/UX Designer<p>“ The online courses at EduVibe were the perfect fit for my busy schedule. I was able to work full-time while pursuing my degree, thanks to the flexibility and convenience of online learning. \"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/client-01-2.png\" alt=\"client-01\"><h6>Nancy Phipps</h6>Digital Marketer<p>“ Attending EduVibe School of Business was one of the best decisions I\'ve ever made. The curriculum was practical and industry-focused, and I was able to apply what I learned in the classroom.\"</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/client-02-2.png\" alt=\"client-02\"><h6>Adam Smith</h6>Web Developer<p>“ I have been using EduVibe for the past six months, and I can honestly say that it has transformed my learning experience. The platform is incredibly user-friendly, and the courses are well-structured and engaging. ”</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/client-03-2.png\" alt=\"client-03\"><h6>Jhaniel Devora</h6>SEO Specialist<p>“ The courses were engaging and the instructors were knowledgeable and supportive. The online platform was easy to use, and I appreciated the flexibility it offered me as a working professional.  ”</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/client-04-2.png\" alt=\"client-04\"><h6>Walter Wilford</h6>JavaScript Engineer<p>“ The online platform was easy to navigate and the instructors were knowledgeable and engaging. I was able to learn at my own pace, which was perfect for my busy schedule.  ”</p><img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/client-01-2.png\" alt=\"client-01\"><h6>Mark Ronson</h6>Digital Marketer<p>“ The courses were practical and relevant to my career goals, and I was able to apply what I learned immediately in my job. Overall, I highly recommend EduVibe to anyone looking for quality learning. ”</p>		\n															<img width=\"59\" height=\"43\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-23-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"77\" height=\"80\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-14-02-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />', 'Inspirations', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9488-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-05 12:57:56', '2025-03-05 12:57:56', '', 9488, 'http://localhost/vashi1/?p=9489', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(9490, 1, '2025-03-05 13:06:54', '2025-03-05 13:06:54', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"460\" height=\"460\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2.png 460w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2-300x300.png 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-01-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\" />															\n															<img width=\"640\" height=\"640\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2.png 739w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-300x300.png 300w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-150x150.png 150w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-600x600.png 600w, https://eduvibe.devsvibe.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-blur-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />															\n			<img src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/about-image-02-2.png\" alt=\"about-image-02\">		\n        2.98\n        Finished<br>\n        Sessions\n															<img width=\"45\" height=\"41\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/shape-11-05-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img width=\"205\" height=\"118\" src=\"http://localhost/vashi1/w